{"id":"wb-5-3","name":"南庄头遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南莊頭遺址","text":"南庄头遗址，是中国华北地区年代最早的新石器时代的遗址，距今约10500-9700年，位于保定市徐水区高林村乡南庄头村东北约2公里处，南距县城12公里，地处太行山东麓余脉，华北平原北部西缘，其东不远有萍河与鸡爪河，周围地形西北逐渐升高，东南逐渐低缓，平均海拔21.4米，面积约20000平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E8%8E%8A%E9%A0%AD%E9%81%BA%E5%9D%80","revisionId":89353635,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89353635","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7f7333c1ddad2756f0dbcc25.jpg","title":"20250118_Deer_Horns_and_Horn_Awls.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250118_Deer_Horns_and_Horn_Awls.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/20250118_Deer_Horns_and_Horn_Awls.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​鹿角、角锥，南庄头遗址出土","width":320,"height":213}}